      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="en">-  Information systems  -&gt;  Database query processing.-  Security and privacy  -&gt;  Database and storage security.-  Theory of computation  -&gt;  Theory of database privacy and security.</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
